    <briefdescription>
<para>Rule-based heuristic compression selector. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Decision logic (evaluated in order):<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>sample_count &lt; min_samples → None (too little data to compress)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>run_length_ratio &gt; rle_run_ratio_threshold → RLE</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>dod_mean_abs ≤ dod_mean_abs_threshold AND timestamp_regularity ≥ regularity_threshold → DeltaOfDelta</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>default → Gorilla </para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
